    "detailed_description": "The city where your vet clinic is located has been struck by a massive financial crisis. You're starting to feel hopeless when you receive a letter inviting you to join a cat rescue at the Muur Islands. Discover a new life in this mysterious island and its cat-healing traditions. Grow medicinal plants, craft medicine, diagnose symptoms, establish relationships with the townsfolk, explore every possible corner and untangle the mysteries the island has to offer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/19ce5f5e6a01cb7cf26e635b8c3e260e.poster.avif?t=1714645821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/19ce5f5e6a01cb7cf26e635b8c3e260e.webm?t=1714645821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grow and harvest medicinal plants native to the island.<br></li><li>Craft treatments for different diseases.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/1369e26bc83d9f084af91134330682bf.poster.avif?t=1714645821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/1369e26bc83d9f084af91134330682bf.webm?t=1714645821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accept patients that other clinics haven't been able to treat.<br></li><li>Diagnose cats using various tests.<br></li><li>Use your own in-house medicine to help your patients.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/f0654501be8dd616e0044fb0c3c91d5b.poster.avif?t=1714645821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/f0654501be8dd616e0044fb0c3c91d5b.webm?t=1714645821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Establish relationships with the island's inhabitants. Make friendships, fall in love, grow the community... choice is yours!<br></li><li>Get to know foreigners that come to the island looking for your invaluable vet skills.<br></li><li>Live all sorts of experiences by attending seasonal festivals with your new neighbors.</li></ul>",
