c3c91d5b.poster.avif?t=1714645821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418320/extras/f0654501be8dd616e0044fb0c3c91d5b.webm?t=1714645821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Establish relationships with the island's inhabitants. Make friendships, fall in love, grow the community... choice is yours!<br></li><li>Get to know foreigners that come to the island looking for your invaluable vet skills.<br></li><li>Live all sorts of experiences by attending seasonal festivals with your new neighbors.</li></ul>",
